  "content": "# 第22题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★☆☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n22. What can students do if a session is full?\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. Fill in the attendance sheet.\n\nB. B. Sign up for the waiting list.\n\nC. C. Report their needs and feedback.\n\nD. D. Email the office their numbers on the list.\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nB\n\n",
  "answer": "A",
  "analysis": "本题考查动词短语辨析。A项‘想出，提出’；B项‘放弃’；C项‘用完’；D项‘处理’。句意：我们需要想出一个解决这个问题的办法。故选A。"
